    parts: ["Halogen headlight bulb H7 12V 55W longlife (qty 4 per car: low and high beam) — 63217160781", "Front turn signal bulb PY24W yellow (halogen lamps) — 07119905468", "Fog bulb H8 12V 35W (qty 2) on 2009+ cars without M aero package — 07119906503", "Fog bulb H11 55W (pre-LCI 2006-2008 only) — 63217160784 (one source only: confirm)", "Halo / parking / daytime-running bulb on halogen LCI lamps (type disputed) (sources disagree: confirm)", "Parking / roadside parking / daytime running lamp bulb H8 12V 35W (BMW manual)", "Parking / roadside parking lamp bulb W5W 5 W (BMW manual; reached through the high-beam headlamp cover)", "Halogen headlamp covers (BMW parts catalog): high-beam covering cap L/R ZKW 63127238826 / 63127238827, VALEO 63127246481 / 63127246482; low-beam lamp cover (VALEO) 63117159564; headlight cover 63127681410 (qty 2). Lamp maker ZKW vs VALEO decides which applies — 63127238826 / 63127238827 / 63127246481 / 63127246482 / 63117159564 / 63127681410", "Lighting unit, light rings (BMW parts catalog halogen diagram): ZKW 63117161444, VALEO 63112179077 (qty 2) — 63117161444 / 63112179077", "Side repeater/additional turn lamp bulb yellow 12V 5W — 63217160798 (one source only: confirm)", "Rear lamp bulbs (sedan): trunk-lid brake lamp H21W 21 W longlife x2 63217160788; backup lamp W16W 16 W longlife x2 63217160935; other lamps P21W 21 W x4 63217160789 — 63217160789 / 63217160788 / 63217160935", "Rear lamp bulb sockets (BMW parts catalog): side-panel (fender) lamp L 63217211213 / R 63217211214; trunk-lid lamp L 63217211211 / R 63217211212 — 63217211213 / 63217211214 / 63217211211 / 63217211212", "Rear lamp LED positions on the US 2010 sedan: roadside parking/tail lamp (2), turn signal (3), tail lamp (5) are LED; brake lamps (1, 6) and backup lamp (4) are bulbs (sources disagree: confirm)", "Tail/brake 21W longlife 63217160790 (Turner, older catalog entry; NOT in the BMW parts catalog for this VIN) — 63217160790 vs 63217160788/63217160789 (one source only: confirm)", "Assorted blade fuses, same rating and colour as the failed fuse. BMW parts catalog colour/amp: Mini 4 A pink, 5 A yellow-brown, 7.5 A brown, 10 A red, 15 A blue, 20 A yellow; blade 5 A light brown 61131372523, 7.5 A brown 61131372524, 10 A red 61131372525, 15 A blue 61131372526, 20 A yellow Maxi 61131372527, 25 A white 61131372528, 30 A green 61131372529, 40 A orange 61138364543", "Fuse allocation map (BMW parts catalog 'Map, fuse grouping') 71239232904; Mini fuses 4 A pink 61136917400, 5 A yellow-brown 61136917401, 7.5 A brown 61136917402, 10 A red 61136917403, 15 A blue 61136917404, 20 A yellow 61136942071; Maxi 20 A yellow 61146940095, 30 A green 61138367146, 40 A orange 61138367132, 50 A red 61138367154, 60 A blue 61136914636; BMW fuse clip 61146936578 — 71239232904"],
